Subject: [PATCH] flourite: enable the Night module entry in the device profile

Adding mode 173 to the default order is insufficient while the Flourite_pro
isSupportedSuperNightScene flag remains false: NightModuleEntry.support()
filters it out before either the main strip or More menu is populated.

Enable the profile flag inherited by Flourite. Do not alter the global
module entry, saved mode order, camera metadata or native night pipelines.

